><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Measurement of insulin absorption and insulin action</article-title><source>Diabetes Technol Ther</source><year>2004</year><volume>6</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>698</fpage><lpage>718</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1089/dia.2004.6.698</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Heinemann L, Anderson JH Jr. Measurement of insulin absorption and insulin action. Diabetes Technol Ther. 2004;6(5):698&#x02013;718. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15628821</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR15"><label>15.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gentilini</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Schaniel</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Morari</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Bieniok</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Wymann</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Schnider</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A new paradigm for the closed-loop intraoperative administration of analgesics in humans</article-title><source>IEEE Trans Biomed Eng</source><year>2002</year><volume>49</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>289</fpage><lpage>299</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1109/10.991156</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Gentilini A, Schaniel C, Morari M, Bieniok C, Wymann R, Schnider T. A new paradigm for the closed-loop intraoperative administration of analgesics in humans. IEEE Trans Biomed Eng. 2002;49(4):289&#x02013;99. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11942720</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR16"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Poon</surname><given-names>EG</given-names></name><name><surname>Blumenthal</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><nam